<title>USA: Nextel's McCaw Intl issues $500 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Nextel's McCaw Intl issues $500 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield issue from McCaw International Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Nextel Communications Inc, was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $250 million and priced with warrants for one percent of the company's equity.</p>
<p>BORROWER MCCAW INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 5-YR ZERO  MATURITY 4/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DISC NOTE ISS PRICE 52.551  FIRST PAY DATE 2002 LAST MOODY'S NR    YIELD 13.00 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI AFTER 5-YRS</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P NR				  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: Three year equity call for 35 percent at 113.</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
